WEBVTT

00:30.660 --> 00:32.300
Can I do, do?

01:39.960 --> 01:43.710
Where bats dwell, vampires shan't be far off.

01:53.010 --> 01:56.140
I suppose it would be impossible.

01:56.140 --> 01:58.820
I shall finish my business and head to my abode.

02:00.250 --> 02:01.890
A bat!

02:09.420 --> 02:11.060
Oh!

02:11.230 --> 02:13.590
Ma'am, allow me to carry you on my back.

02:13.600 --> 02:15.200
I couldn't...

02:15.200 --> 02:17.180
It's my genuine pleasure.

02:20.300 --> 02:22.370
I'm sorry about this.

02:22.370 --> 02:24.350
You needn't worry about it.

02:26.170 --> 02:28.180
Thank you very much.

02:28.180 --> 02:31.110
Yes, take care now.

02:31.110 --> 02:33.720
Oh! Where did the bat scurry off to?

02:42.360 --> 02:45.360
I know it went this way.

02:48.130 --> 02:51.330
That mansion looks rather suspicious.

02:51.330 --> 02:53.570
Something's going on there.

03:06.620 --> 03:08.600
It's loud tonight.

03:09.080 --> 03:11.450
The moon is beautiful,

03:11.450 --> 03:13.620
and a tea party makes for a lovely eve,

03:13.620 --> 03:15.260
Sister.

03:15.590 --> 03:18.470
It'd be nice if every night was like this.

03:24.530 --> 03:26.340
Someone's there!

03:26.440 --> 03:27.670
Easy now!

03:27.670 --> 03:29.100
An assassin?!

03:29.100 --> 03:31.240
I wouldn't be so sure about that.

03:31.740 --> 03:34.810
I've found you, die!

03:35.780 --> 03:37.590
Prepare thyself!

03:42.420 --> 03:43.920
What?!

03:43.920 --> 03:45.690
A..Are you all right?

03:46.720 --> 03:47.890
This is nothing!

03:47.890 --> 03:49.820
For I am a vampire hunter!

03:49.830 --> 03:51.190
Vampire hunter?

03:51.190 --> 03:53.360
I swear I will take your life!

03:53.360 --> 03:54.430
Sherwood?

03:54.430 --> 03:56.240
Yes, Sister.

03:59.970 --> 04:03.440
U..Umm, Hime isn't a vampire.

04:04.240 --> 04:05.810
H..Hime?!

04:05.810 --> 04:07.980
She's a princess from the Royal Family.

04:13.380 --> 04:15.680
I had no idea you were a royal princess!

04:15.680 --> 04:17.520
My sincere apologies, m'lady!

04:17.520 --> 04:20.550
You sneak onto my property
without my permission

04:20.560 --> 04:23.000
and mistake me for a vampire.

04:23.660 --> 04:26.660
I hope you've prepared yourself.

04:27.930 --> 04:31.270
Y..Your beauty vexed me into thinking
you were a vampire!

04:31.270 --> 04:33.610
Pl..Please accept my apology!

04:35.070 --> 04:36.740
Hime...

04:40.780 --> 04:42.410
Huga.

04:45.980 --> 04:49.280
Confusing my sister for a vampire...

04:49.280 --> 04:50.820
Are you a rookie?

04:50.820 --> 04:53.730
I am! So, please hear me out!

04:54.420 --> 04:59.420
I was laid off from my job in my homeland
after seven years. I had nothing to eat.

04:59.930 --> 05:04.000
I became a vampire hunter in
order to feed my family.

05:04.000 --> 05:07.100
I'm not sure if you're aware, Your Highness,

05:07.100 --> 05:10.100
but they pay a reward for slain vampires.

05:10.110 --> 05:12.240
And it's quite handsome indeed!

05:14.610 --> 05:17.880
So, it would allow my family to eat well,

05:17.880 --> 05:19.520
but...

05:19.980 --> 05:21.960
Get out of my sight.

05:22.220 --> 05:24.030
Or else...

05:24.620 --> 05:26.430
I..I'll take my leave!

05:29.160 --> 05:31.360
I feel kinda bad for him.

05:31.360 --> 05:33.170
Huh? Did something happen?

05:33.600 --> 05:37.810
No, nothing, just a peaceful evening.

05:43.540 --> 05:45.240
Ow, ow, ow...

05:45.240 --> 05:48.050
I had no idea that mansion belonged to royalty.

05:58.650 --> 06:00.660
Well? Tastes good?

06:03.860 --> 06:08.060
I wonder if my children back home
are starving, too?

06:08.060 --> 06:10.480
I suppose I should start heading back.

06:12.700 --> 06:14.340
Bats!

06:18.840 --> 06:20.840
General Hospital

06:21.410 --> 06:23.950
There must be a vampire here.

06:27.480 --> 06:32.450
I can smell it from a mile away.
A vampire dwells here.

06:37.560 --> 06:38.970
There's a lovely moon out tonight.

06:40.100 --> 06:42.970
I'd love to dance with the princess tonight.

06:45.970 --> 06:47.780
Are you in here?!

06:48.840 --> 06:51.040
Oh, you actually are in here.

06:51.610 --> 06:53.670
I don't recognize your face.

06:53.680 --> 06:55.880
You don't work in the hospital, huh?

06:55.880 --> 07:00.050
I'm Shigara of the Tanuki race that lives on
the outskirts of the Royal Kingdom.

07:00.050 --> 07:03.680
I am a vampire hunter!

07:03.690 --> 07:06.220
Remember my name well.

07:06.220 --> 07:10.060
My, what a polite introduction.
I'm honored.

07:10.060 --> 07:13.100
My name is Zeppeli, I'm a vampire.

07:14.900 --> 07:17.380
Now then, take this!

07:17.570 --> 07:21.570
That doesn't even work on low-level
vampires in this day and age.

07:21.570 --> 07:23.170
Then, take this!

07:23.170 --> 07:25.880
It stinks, but that's it.

07:26.440 --> 07:30.180
Then, I guess I'll have to resort to brute force.

07:30.180 --> 07:31.990
Take this!

07:32.450 --> 07:37.450
Do you really think you can kill a vampire
with such a cheap dagger,

07:37.890 --> 07:39.890
Vampire Hunter?

07:39.890 --> 07:41.700
You bore me.

07:42.720 --> 07:46.730
I'm Hosei Sanagida, at your service!

07:46.730 --> 07:49.360
You rang, Master?

07:49.360 --> 07:51.970
Get him out of here, but be polite about it.

07:52.730 --> 07:57.270
He came to kill you and you're just going
to let him go home unscathed?

07:57.270 --> 08:01.510
At the very least, we should dissect him,
and let the interns use him to study anatomy!

08:01.510 --> 08:03.610
We needn't go as far as to kill him.

08:03.610 --> 08:07.750
Your mercy runs deeper than the
Marianas Trench, Master.

08:07.950 --> 08:10.260
Well, then...

08:11.550 --> 08:13.490
Hold it! Hold it, hold it!

08:13.490 --> 08:15.690
You think I'm gonna hold it because
you told me to?!

08:15.690 --> 08:17.330
Wait!

08:23.770 --> 08:25.530
R..Reiri!

08:25.530 --> 08:28.880
Good evening, everyone,
such lovely weather tonight.

08:29.140 --> 08:30.570
Is that the vampire?

08:30.570 --> 08:33.140
Nobody invited you!

08:34.540 --> 08:38.810
Princess, would it be all right for
me to join your tea party?

08:38.810 --> 08:40.480
Do whatever you'd like.

08:40.480 --> 08:41.580
Sheesh...

08:41.580 --> 08:43.420
Please calm down.

08:43.420 --> 08:45.290
You do whatever you want!

08:45.290 --> 08:47.320
I'm going to clean up and go to bed!

08:47.320 --> 08:48.960
Oh, going to lick your coat?

08:48.960 --> 08:50.600
What?!

08:54.700 --> 08:58.070
Wanna take a bath with me, Hiro?

08:58.070 --> 09:00.570
I was joking! What an idiot!

09:04.470 --> 09:07.650
How about taking one with me?
And I'm not joking.

09:11.950 --> 09:16.690
Hiro, if you absolutely insist,
you can take one with me.

09:17.320 --> 09:20.960
Umm, well, umm...

09:22.490 --> 09:24.970
Want to wash my back?

09:29.700 --> 09:31.370
Fool...

09:38.770 --> 09:41.040
I thought this lovely moonlit eve

09:41.040 --> 09:44.310
would be the perfect backdrop for
drinking the princess's blood,

09:44.310 --> 09:46.660
but it seems Reiri beat me to the punch.

09:53.190 --> 09:56.000
Man, what a great bath.

09:57.430 --> 09:59.530
Taking a bath together...

10:00.300 --> 10:03.330
The moon is lovely tonight, don't you agree?

10:03.330 --> 10:04.570
Yeah...

10:05.330 --> 10:10.440
To be all alone with you on such
a beautiful night, I'm honored.

10:12.110 --> 10:13.920
You aren't getting my blood.

10:14.980 --> 10:18.290
Oh, how disappointing.

10:22.050 --> 10:23.650
Miss Reiri,

10:23.650 --> 10:26.450
I hate to ruin your special date with the princess,

10:26.450 --> 10:30.700
but I won't even share a drop
of her blood with you.

10:34.230 --> 10:36.800
Catch me if you can!

10:36.800 --> 10:38.610
Hold it, you!

10:39.970 --> 10:41.570
My goodness...

10:41.570 --> 10:45.310
I thought of intruding myself,
but it seems someone else is intruding.

10:48.640 --> 10:49.980
Vampire!

10:49.980 --> 10:53.720
I'll kill you for sure this time!

10:57.220 --> 10:59.220
Hiro, that jerk.

11:06.960 --> 11:08.740
Hiro?

11:11.170 --> 11:13.980
What, it's you?! Stay out of here!

11:18.510 --> 11:23.180
Master, let's just finish him off, once and for all.

11:23.180 --> 11:27.420
W..Wait! I have a wife and children
who are starving back home!

11:27.620 --> 11:29.320
He's bothersome.

11:29.320 --> 11:31.130
Shall we kill him?

11:32.020 --> 11:34.720
Yes! Let's do that!

11:34.720 --> 11:36.530
Good idea!

11:44.330 --> 11:46.970
Let me tell you some valuable information.

11:46.970 --> 11:50.710
There are vampires other than me in this town.

11:54.880 --> 11:56.540
I see!

11:56.540 --> 12:00.550
I appreciate your kindness.
Thank you, sir!

12:00.550 --> 12:05.150
Reiri seems rather bored lately, too.

12:05.150 --> 12:07.530
This should help relieve her of
some of that boredom.

12:09.160 --> 12:10.560
Morning.

12:10.560 --> 12:12.200
Morning

12:15.900 --> 12:18.870
Good morning, Reiri.

12:18.870 --> 12:20.770
Good morning.

12:20.770 --> 12:22.470
Nice weather we're having.

12:22.470 --> 12:24.280
It certainly is.

12:28.580 --> 12:33.620
In the Middle Ages, the lords were highly
influential in Europe and...

12:38.720 --> 12:40.360
Hiro!

12:43.960 --> 12:45.290
What's with him?

12:45.290 --> 12:47.760
Getting close with Kamura?

12:47.760 --> 12:49.570
That asshole!

13:05.950 --> 13:07.750
He's been following you?

13:07.750 --> 13:10.420
Yes, non-stop since this morning.

13:10.420 --> 13:12.490
Hiro, do something about it.

13:12.490 --> 13:14.470
What can I do?

13:15.190 --> 13:17.930
Consider yourself dead, vampire!

13:26.230 --> 13:29.040
Come on, do something.

13:29.040 --> 13:32.110
I can't do a thing under him!

13:34.640 --> 13:37.820
Why do I have to be on gardening duty?

13:38.480 --> 13:42.580
Freeloader, do some work and then you can talk.

13:42.580 --> 13:44.220
Make yourself useful.

13:44.220 --> 13:45.890
Don't order me around!

13:45.890 --> 13:47.150
Sheesh!

13:47.160 --> 13:50.690
You really help us by doing this, Liza.

13:50.690 --> 13:51.890
Huga!

13:51.890 --> 13:55.640
Flan and I are going shopping,
so please keep working.

13:59.200 --> 14:03.210
My wife, my children, Daddy's gonna do this!

14:05.170 --> 14:06.840
What's wrong?

14:06.840 --> 14:09.190
I lost my mom!

14:09.380 --> 14:11.450
All right, leave it to me!

14:16.080 --> 14:18.550
Is this boy's mother around?

14:18.550 --> 14:20.400
Mom!

14:21.690 --> 14:25.640
I wonder if my kids are crying
because they miss me, too?

14:27.130 --> 14:30.700
Thank you so much!
Thank you so much!

14:30.930 --> 14:34.040
Don't leave your mom's sight again, okay?

14:35.370 --> 14:37.180
Darn it!

14:48.550 --> 14:50.480
Master...

14:50.490 --> 14:52.420
Sawawa...

14:52.420 --> 14:55.720
You're such a dandy, Honey.

14:55.720 --> 14:58.900
You're so lovely, Baby.

15:04.730 --> 15:06.370
Master?

15:07.200 --> 15:10.180
Master, can I have another?

15:11.170 --> 15:12.810
Master?

15:13.140 --> 15:14.680
Don't you mean "Honey"?

15:14.880 --> 15:16.510
Huh?

15:18.310 --> 15:20.120
Right away, ma'am.

15:20.410 --> 15:23.080
Flan, wanna read my manga?

15:23.080 --> 15:24.550
Let's play pogs!

15:24.550 --> 15:25.550
Huga.

15:25.550 --> 15:28.120
I'll give you a pretty marble.

15:30.460 --> 15:33.270
You know, this is kinda fun.

15:33.760 --> 15:35.530
Wanna do it too, Hiro?

15:35.530 --> 15:37.640
I'll pass.

15:38.030 --> 15:41.010
My sister and Flandre sure are late.

15:43.700 --> 15:47.410
All right, I think I'll call it a day.

15:47.410 --> 15:51.040
Maybe I'll go drink tea with the princess
again when I wake up.

15:51.050 --> 15:54.480
Sis! Flandre!

15:54.480 --> 15:54.750
Okay!

15:55.750 --> 15:56.880
Come on...

15:56.880 --> 15:57.920
You can do it!

15:57.920 --> 15:59.730
Almost there!

16:00.520 --> 16:02.800
Almost there... Almost there...

16:05.590 --> 16:08.090
Oh, Hiro, what are you doing?

16:08.100 --> 16:10.260
Sis! Flandre!

16:10.260 --> 16:12.000
You have to come straight home after school.

16:12.000 --> 16:12.800
Huga.

16:12.800 --> 16:14.440
That's not why I'm out!

16:14.500 --> 16:16.270
Let's hurry home.

16:16.270 --> 16:18.270
The Mistress is waiting for us.

16:18.270 --> 16:19.610
Huga.

16:19.610 --> 16:21.880
H..Hang on a sec!

16:21.880 --> 16:24.980
I came to get you, since you were taking so long!

16:25.750 --> 16:27.380
Geez...

16:32.690 --> 16:37.190
Well then, shall I go partake of
the princess's blood?

16:37.190 --> 16:42.030
Miss Reiri should be keeping that
dumb vampire hunter busy.

16:42.030 --> 16:44.170
Where did you go, you lady vampire?!

16:49.840 --> 16:54.310
I am truly grateful you summoned
me again today, sir.

16:57.210 --> 17:00.660
If I don't hurry and kill that vampire and go home,
my wife and kids will...

17:06.990 --> 17:07.720
Him again!

17:07.720 --> 17:09.960
Him again!

17:12.860 --> 17:15.240
Huh? I don't have any soap.

17:24.040 --> 17:25.680
Huga.

17:33.580 --> 17:35.780
WhY must you run? Why?!

17:35.780 --> 17:38.290
Because you're chasing me, that's why!

17:38.490 --> 17:41.800
But I have a message from my master!

17:42.660 --> 17:44.300
Message?

17:46.330 --> 17:50.100
The whereabouts of that female vampire...

17:55.440 --> 17:56.970
Thank you!

17:56.970 --> 17:59.110
Don't mention it.

18:12.350 --> 18:14.990
There's no one to stand in my way tonight.

18:15.260 --> 18:21.430
Come, let's dance a wondrous dance
under the moonlight, Princess.

18:25.630 --> 18:30.300
My goodness, you've distracted me
from what I was doing.

18:30.300 --> 18:35.120
But it's improper to peek on a lady
while she's sleeping.

18:35.840 --> 18:37.210
I'm sorry.

18:37.210 --> 18:40.750
You're just so lovely, I couldn't resist.

18:40.750 --> 18:43.190
My, quite an honest response.

18:44.050 --> 18:47.160
Though my wife's beauty exceeds yours.

18:49.190 --> 18:52.400
How did you find me in this church?

18:53.530 --> 18:56.400
A kind soul told me its location.

18:56.400 --> 18:57.900
A kind soul?

18:57.900 --> 19:02.410
I didn't catch his name,
but he's of the same race as you.

19:03.070 --> 19:04.710
Zeppeli...

19:06.440 --> 19:10.180
Hurry back to your family.

19:10.180 --> 19:12.160
Otherwise, I'll have to

19:14.080 --> 19:17.120
I'll do whatever you want, just please let me go!

19:17.120 --> 19:19.890
Then, do as I said.

19:25.560 --> 19:27.200
Huga.

19:27.800 --> 19:30.110
Well then, I will make my move.

19:31.170 --> 19:35.270
I won't allow you to have the princess's blood.

19:35.270 --> 19:39.440
My, my, that vampire hunter
proved useless after all.

19:39.440 --> 19:42.340
I thought he'd be able to tie you up,
at the very least.

19:42.340 --> 19:46.620
Making him sneak into a lady's room
uninvited is reprehensible!

19:54.490 --> 19:58.270
Miss Reiri, do you truly plan to kill me?

19:59.830 --> 20:02.830
You're becoming a true eyesore to me, Zeppeli.

20:02.830 --> 20:05.070
Then, my condolences, Miss Reiri,

20:05.070 --> 20:07.910
but I shall have to fight for real, too!

20:14.180 --> 20:17.950
What's wrong? Come and attack, Miss Reiri.

20:31.560 --> 20:35.560
A white ash stake...

20:35.560 --> 20:38.540
How did you know?

20:40.270 --> 20:45.080
You're the one behind this,
aren't you, Miss Reiri?

20:48.810 --> 20:51.950
My wife, my kids, Daddy did it!

20:51.950 --> 20:53.880
Daddy's finally done it!

20:53.880 --> 20:56.230
Now I can get the bounty money!

20:56.720 --> 20:59.020
Thank you kindly, lady vampire.

20:59.020 --> 21:00.650
Thank you from the bottom of my heart!

21:00.650 --> 21:01.890
I'm sorry.

21:01.890 --> 21:02.890
MY apologies.

21:02.890 --> 21:04.060
Please forgive me.

21:04.060 --> 21:07.390
Please do not haunt me.

21:07.400 --> 21:10.130
I'll be certain to leave your soul offerings
at O-bon and New Years!

21:10.130 --> 21:14.630
My wife, my kids, Daddy's on his way!

21:14.640 --> 21:16.270
Farewell!

21:25.050 --> 21:27.050
Did something happen?

21:27.050 --> 21:31.090
No, nothing at all, just a peaceful night.

21:37.020 --> 21:39.030
General Hospital

21:39.030 --> 21:41.730
You gave quite the performance.

21:41.730 --> 21:46.730
But now we won't have to encounter
that vampire hunter again.

21:46.870 --> 21:49.040
You're terrible, Miss Reiri.

21:49.040 --> 21:54.040
Using someone like that,
he very well might have pierced my heart.

21:54.640 --> 21:58.280
My, I'm disappointed he didn't.

23:42.480 --> 23:45.520
Blue water goes on for as far as the eye can see!

23:45.750 --> 23:48.420
White clouds float across the sky like pearls!

23:48.420 --> 23:49.420
Huga.

23:49.420 --> 23:52.460
Oh, life-giving ocean,
you grant us abundant water.

23:52.460 --> 23:57.400
The sun's rays come down in droves, sparkling,
dazzling, vividly shimmering across the surface!

23:57.400 --> 23:58.230
Huga.

23:58.230 --> 24:00.930
The sun beats down! The sun burns vividly!

24:00.940 --> 24:01.940
Huga.

24:01.940 --> 24:03.700
Next episode, "Princess Ocean"

24:03.700 --> 24:06.170
We're sparkling with our youth!

24:06.170 --> 24:07.840
Though there's an eerie ghost ship there with you.

24:09.280 --> 24:10.780
Huga, huga.
